  "scope": "Original production world/body/rigid-body propagation, celestial/planet/base/vessel dynamics, CPU mesh and terrain archives, explicit platform services, indexed resources and checked source-built SPICE/atmosphere/ShuttlePB modules. Original Camera and Session/WorldOwner ordering, native external graphics contract and shared drawing/celestial-sphere algorithms. Native flight host with fixed real-time ticks, original key mapping and immediate/buffered/joystick directional controls, stock docking and serialization. Windows SDK types/layouts/exports are preserved. General application modules, cockpit/instrumentation, Lua and full stock compatibility remain incomplete. Numerical/image references and budgets remain immutable; runtime gates are separate from source conservation.",
